OL,5,G2100 Warship: Life in the Royal Navy
OL,6,     FJJ Chalmers joins recruits
OL,7,     Fpreparing for the realities of
OL,8,     Fwar, including chemical attack.
OL,9,     FAnd a new helicopter pilot lands
OL,10,     Fon the deck of a moving warship
OL,11,     Ffor the first time.
OL,12,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,13,     FKamikaze pilots guard the island
OL,14,     Fof Okinawa as American forces
OL,15,     Fapproach.
OL,16,G2235 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,17,     FIn 1945, Soviet and American
OL,18,     Ftroops press Hitler's armies from
OL,19,     Fthe west and the east, culminating
OL,20,     Fin the fall of Berlin.
